  "theorem": {
    "name": "Registered multiplier-decorated recentered seam theorem",
    "statement": "Given the permanent Audit019 multiplier-decorated G60 state table and the two Audit028C registered five-seam systems, exact multiplier preservation selects one unique reflected offset at each of the 24 anchors. Recentring the cross-registration position map at each of the 60 G60 states produces a unique affine action r -> mu_T*r mod 5, where mu_T is 2 or 3. Exactly 40 states carry multiplier 2 and 20 carry multiplier 3. All 300 state-residue actions agree exactly, and typed registration exchange preserves the multiplier."
